# Retranslations (#4799): "Keuzelijsten" is the one Dutch word for the
# lookups area, replacing "Lookuplijsten", "Lookups", "Opzoeklijsten",
# "Opzoekwaarde(n)" and the "lookup-" compounds. The English msgids stay.
# Technical names keep their English form: the `_Lookups` sheet of the
# Excel template, the entity slugs in the matrix filter hint, and lookup
# type keys such as activity_type.

